            <trans-unit id="table.description.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown above the prices in every layout, e.g. “All prices per month, plus VAT.”</source><target>Kuvatakse hindade kohal igas paigutuses, nt „Kõik hinnad kuus, lisandub käibemaks.“</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode" approved="yes"><source>Entered amounts are</source><target>Sisestatud summad on</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.hint" approved="yes"><source>Defines how the entered amounts are read. Conversion only runs from net to gross, never the other way round.</source><target>Määrab, kuidas sisestatud summasid tõlgendatakse. Teisendamine toimub ainult netost brutosse, mitte kunagi vastupidi.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.net" approved="yes"><source>Net prices</source><target>Netohinnad</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.gross" approved="yes"><source>Gross prices</source><target>Brutohinnad</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate" approved="yes"><source>Tax rate in percent</source><target>Maksumäär protsentides</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate.hint" approved="yes"><source>Basis for the gross display. 0 skips the conversion.</source><target>Bruto kuvamise alus. 0 jätab teisendamise vahele.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Visitors may switch between net and gross</source><target>Külastajad saavad lülituda neto ja bruto vahel</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the page only shows the option selected above.</source><target>Märkimata korral kuvab leht ainult ülal valitud valikut.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Currency switchable</source><target>Valuuta vahetatav</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one currency is entered for the plans.</source><target>Lüliti ilmub ainult siis, kui pakettidele on sisestatud rohkem kui üks valuuta.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Billing period switchable</source><target>Arveldusperioodi vahetatav</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one period is entered for the plans.</source><target>Lüliti ilmub ainult siis, kui pakettidele on sisestatud rohkem kui üks periood.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition" approved="yes"><source>Currency symbol</source><target>Valuuta sümbol</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.hint" approved="yes"><source>English usually puts it before the amount (“€ 99”), German and most continental European languages after it (“99 €”).</source><target>Inglise keeles on see tavaliselt summa ees („€ 99“), saksa ja enamikus mandri-Euroopa keeltes summa järel („99 €“).</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.before" approved="yes"><source>before the amount (€ 99)</source><target>summa ees (€ 99)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.after" approved="yes"><source>after the amount (99 €)</source><target>summa järel (99 €)</target></trans-unit>
