            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Popular</source><target>Populaarne</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink" approved="yes"><source>Select button target</source><target>Vali-nupu siht</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink.hint" approved="yes"><source>Without a link no button is rendered — neither an empty one nor a placeholder.</source><target>Ilma lingita nuppu ei kuvata — ei tühja ega asendusteksti.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own label</source><target>Oma silt</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Overrides the label from the pricing table, for this plan only.</source><target>Alistab hinnatabeli sildi ainult selle paketi jaoks.</target></trans-unit>
