            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Paigutus</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards for a few plans, compact rows from about five, the comparison table for many features.</source><target>Paketikaardid mõne paketi jaoks, kompaktsed read alates umbes viiest, võrdlustabel paljude funktsioonide jaoks.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.cards" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards</source><target>Paketikaardid</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.matrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table</source><target>Võrdlustabel</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.groups" approved="yes"><source>Cards with feature groups</source><target>Kaardid funktsioonigruppidega</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.rows" approved="yes"><source>Compact rows</source><target>Kompaktsed read</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.accordion" approved="yes"><source>Cards with expandable details</source><target>Kaardid laiendatavate üksikasjadega</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Also show comparison table</source><target>Kuva ka võrdlustabel</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table then appears below the chosen layout.</source><target>Võrdlustabel kuvatakse seejärel valitud paigutuse all.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table collapsed</source><target>Võrdlustabel ahendatud</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table only opens on click — keeps the page calm with many features.</source><target>Võrdlustabel avaneb ainult klõpsamisel — hoiab lehe rahulikuna paljude funktsioonide korral.</target></trans-unit>
